Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Craig Interpolation Theorem(b), §2.5.5, print56–58/PDF68–70"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source partitioned statement and specialization checked; full proof not reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2\\)</span> 为 Σ 上有限公式序列；串接、单元素序列与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a>。voc 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c5a5b5ff728bc74\" href=\"?note=0c5a5b5ff728bc74\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary\">72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\Delta_2\\rangle)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\operatorname{voc}(C)\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Delta_1)\\cap\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_2^\\frown\\Delta_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\langle C\\rangle\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\langle C\\rangle^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_2\\rangle)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\Delta_2\\rangle)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n\\operatorname{voc}(C)\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Delta_1)\\cap\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_2^\\frown\\Delta_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\langle C\\rangle\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\langle C\\rangle^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_2\\rangle)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格保留分割两侧的方向：C 加到第一块的后件，同时加到第二块的前件。取 Γ₁=⟨A⟩、Δ₂=⟨B⟩、其余为空，就得到通常 A→C→B。公式存在性的源归纳还要控制量词本征变量；本轮未把一般身份等号版的全部证明视为已机器核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary","status":"resolved","id":"0c5a5b5ff728bc74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2$ 为 Σ 上有限公式序列；串接、单元素序列与 $\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。voc 取 [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary","status":"resolved","id":"0c5a5b5ff728bc74","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2$ 为 Σ 上有限公式序列；串接、单元素序列与 $\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。voc 取 [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\Delta_2\\rangle)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists C\\in X_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[&\n\\operatorname{voc}(C)\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_1^\\frown\\Delta_1)\\cap\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_2^\\frown\\Delta_2)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Gamma_1,\\Delta_1^\\frown\\langle C\\rangle\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\langle C\\rangle^\\frown\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_2\\rangle)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1984,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-491","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"}],"outgoing":["0c5a5b5ff728bc74","ba1b086fe1d56f25"]}